<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Thresholds</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Prediction probabilities and labels, along with the chosen thresholds are visualized in Figures <a href="#A4.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Appendix D F-Metric Results ‣ Evaluation of Stress Detection as Time Series Events – A Novel Window-Based F1-metric" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, <a href="#A4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix D F-Metric Results ‣ Evaluation of Stress Detection as Time Series Events – A Novel Window-Based F1-metric" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, and <a href="#A4.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix D F-Metric Results ‣ Evaluation of Stress Detection as Time Series Events – A Novel Window-Based F1-metric" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
